units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 1.0
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10
mass 1 58.6934
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

pair_style zero 10.0
pair_coeff * *
mass 1 27
velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1.0
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal
run 10
